        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>狗狗训练指南 - 稳定随行 &amp; 拒食训练</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #f2ede0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n  .card {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: #fbf3e6;\n    border: 3px dashed #e8a020;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 16px 18px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .section {\n    position: relative;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .title-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .title-main {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #3a7d2c;\n    margin-right: 10px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .title-main::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    display: block;\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    bottom: -3px;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 6px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #f0a94a 0 6px, transparent 6px 10px);\n    z-index: -1;\n  }\n  .title-sub {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #333;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .content-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .text-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .text-col p {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  .circ-num {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .hl {\n    background: #f6c9d3;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .img-col {\n    width: 130px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #fdf6ea;\n    border: 1px dashed #ccb98a;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .corgi-top {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 150px;\n    margin-left: auto;\n  }\n  .corgi-left {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 190px;\n  }\n  .walk-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .walk-img {\n    width: 150px;\n    height: 130px;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    border-top: 2px dashed #333;\n    margin: 14px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 14px;\n    top: 45%;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: rgba(150,150,150,0.15);\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"card\">\n\n  <!-- Section 1 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"title-row\">\n      <span class=\"title-main\">稳定随行</span>\n      <span class=\"title-sub\">训练狗狗跟着人走而不是人跟着狗走</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"text-col\">\n        <p><span class=\"circ-num\">①</span>前期可以选择靠墙位置，用玩具或零食吸引狗狗注意力在人身上</p>\n        <p><span class=\"circ-num\">②</span>如果狗狗出现前冲或者爆冲行为，<span class=\"hl\">主人要握紧牵绳，原地保持不</span>动，或者右转90度，让狗狗走在你身后</p>\n        <p><span class=\"circ-num\">③</span>狗狗一旦回头找你或者牵引绳恢复了松弛状态，你再继续走，重复多次</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"img-col\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder corgi-top\">[Illustration: 柯基犬伸舌坐姿，右上角]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"walk-row\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder walk-img\">[Illustration: 比格犬跟随主人行走，图1]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder walk-img\">[Illustration: 比格犬跟随主人行走，图2]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder walk-img\">[Illustration: 比格犬跟随主人回头，图3]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Section 2 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"title-row\">\n      <span class=\"title-main\">拒食训练</span>\n      <span class=\"title-sub\">训练狗狗不随便在外面捡东西吃</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"img-col\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder corgi-left\">[Illustration: 柯基犬坐立捧食姿态]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text-col\">\n        <p><span class=\"circ-num\">①</span>戴上牵引绳，将狗狗爱吃的零食放在手上，当它想吃的时候，<span class=\"hl\">拉绳子说NO,并握紧食物，反复训练直</span>到狗狗看到手中食物就避开</p>\n        <p><span class=\"circ-num\">②</span>当狗狗能做到在手里的食物可以成功拒食后，<span class=\"hl\">可以把食物放在地上，带狗狗经过，狗</span>狗嗅闻的时候，拉绳子说NO，直到狗狗无视地上食物</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">水印</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
